  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your prayers heal and purify as your touch.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Word of Healing<sup>UM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> The range at which you can use your lay on hands ability is extended by 10 feet per mythic tier and the healing is not halved if the target is within 5 feet times your mythic tier. In addition, you may use this ability to harm undead as well as to heal the living.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-t-z-feats#toc35\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
